{"id":"u114","kelas":"toeic","no":1,"judul":"Mengenal Tes TOEIC","title":"TOEIC Overview","emoji":"🧭","ringkas":"Format, bagian tes, skor 10 sampai 990, dan strategi umum","ready":true,"goals":["memahami **format TOEIC Listening and Reading**: 7 bagian, 200 soal","mengetahui **skor 10 sampai 990** dan cara mengatur waktu","mengenali **jenis soal** tiap bagian","menyusun **strategi belajar** yang realistis"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"**TOEIC** (Test of English for International Communication) mengukur kemampuan bahasa Inggris di **lingkungan kerja**: email, rapat, perjalanan dinas, dan layanan pelanggan. Banyak perusahaan memakainya untuk seleksi atau promosi. Unit ini menjelaskan format tes. Ingat: detail tes dapat berubah, jadi **periksa situs resmi penyelenggara** menjelang kamu mendaftar."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Format TOEIC Listening and Reading","table":[["Bagian","Soal","Isi"],["**Listening** (sekitar 45 menit, 100 soal)","",""],["Part 1: Photographs","6","memilih kalimat yang menggambarkan foto"],["Part 2: Question-Response","25","pertanyaan pendek, pilih jawaban terbaik"],["Part 3: Conversations","39","percakapan 2 atau 3 orang, 3 soal tiap percakapan"],["Part 4: Talks","30","pengumuman, pidato, pesan telepon, 3 soal tiap teks"],["**Reading** (75 menit, 100 soal)","",""],["Part 5: Incomplete Sentences","30","tata bahasa dan kosakata dalam satu kalimat"],["Part 6: Text Completion","16","melengkapi teks pendek (termasuk kalimat yang hilang)"],["Part 7: Reading Comprehension","54","email, iklan, pengumuman, artikel, teks ganda"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[Total: 200 soal dalam sekitar 2 jam.]]","id":"Total 200 soal dalam sekitar 2 jam."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Skor dan strategi waktu","table":[["Hal","Keterangan"],["Skor total","10 sampai 990 (Listening 5–495 + Reading 5–495)"],["Tipe soal","pilihan ganda; tidak ada pengurangan nilai bila salah"],["Listening","rekaman diputar sekali; jawab sambil mendengar"],["Reading","kamu mengatur waktu sendiri; Part 5 cepat (sekitar 20 detik per soal)"],["Strategi","jangan kosongkan jawaban; tebak bila perlu"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Ciri khas TOEIC","table":[["Ciri","Contoh"],["Topik dunia kerja","[[office, meeting, invoice, delivery, schedule]]"],["Aksen beragam","Amerika, Inggris, Kanada, Australia"],["Pertanyaan umum","[[What is the purpose of the email?]] / [[What will the woman do next?]]"],["Jawaban jebakan","kata yang sama bunyinya atau kata yang muncul tetapi tidak menjawab"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Mulai dari yang paling mudah dinaikkan","text":"Banyak peserta menaikkan skor paling cepat di **Part 5** (tata bahasa dan kosakata) dan **Part 2** (tanya jawab pendek) karena soalnya singkat dan polanya berulang."},{"t":"warn","title":"Waktu Reading sangat ketat","text":"Tidak ada waktu menerjemahkan semua kata. Kerjakan Part 5 dan 6 cepat, sisakan waktu untuk Part 7. Jangan terpaku pada satu soal sulit."},{"t":"summary","items":["TOEIC L&R: 200 soal, sekitar 2 jam; Listening (4 part) dan Reading (3 part).","Skor 10–990.","Topik dunia kerja.","Part 5 dan Part 2 mudah ditingkatkan lewat latihan pola."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa jumlah soal TOEIC Listening and Reading?","options":["200","100","120","300"],"answer":0,"exp":"100 Listening + 100 Reading.","k":"4c2c0ca3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada bagian Listening?","options":["100","50","75","200"],"answer":0,"exp":"100 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **100**.","k":"421a8828"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada bagian Reading?","options":["100","50","75","200"],"answer":0,"exp":"100 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **100**.","k":"667ddc41"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa lama waktu Reading?","options":["75 menit","45 menit","30 menit","120 menit"],"answer":0,"exp":"75 menit. Jawaban yang tepat: **75 menit**.","k":"3bdc755a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa lama sekitar bagian Listening?","options":["sekitar 45 menit","sekitar 75 menit","sekitar 10 menit","sekitar 2 jam"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sekitar 45 menit.","k":"61245a3d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa skor maksimum TOEIC Listening and Reading?","options":["990","100","9","1000"],"answer":0,"exp":"Skala 10–990.","k":"28267c0d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa skor minimum yang tercatat?","options":["10","0","100","5"],"answer":0,"exp":"Skala 10–990.","k":"50dc202f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagaimana skor Listening dan Reading digabung?","options":["dijumlah menjadi skor total","diambil yang tertinggi","dirata-rata dengan Speaking","tidak digabung"],"answer":0,"exp":"Total 10–990.","k":"de0fb7f7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa yang dilakukan pada Part 1?","options":["memilih kalimat yang menggambarkan foto","menjawab pertanyaan tentang email","melengkapi kalimat","menulis esai"],"answer":0,"exp":"Photographs. Jawaban yang tepat: **memilih kalimat yang menggambarkan foto**.","k":"fa87b496"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa yang dilakukan pada Part 2?","options":["memilih jawaban untuk pertanyaan pendek","membaca iklan","menulis surat","melengkapi tabel"],"answer":0,"exp":"Question-Response.","k":"99a6cf53"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada Part 2?","options":["25","6","39","30"],"answer":0,"exp":"25 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **25**.","k":"eda9fe19"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada Part 3?","options":["39","25","30","54"],"answer":0,"exp":"39 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **39**.","k":"2c6ccfd8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada Part 4?","options":["30","25","39","16"],"answer":0,"exp":"30 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **30**.","k":"ad6676f9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada Part 5?","options":["30","16","54","6"],"answer":0,"exp":"30 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **30**.","k":"684c4b70"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada Part 6?","options":["16","30","54","25"],"answer":0,"exp":"16 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **16**.","k":"983a9754"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada Part 7?","options":["54","30","16","39"],"answer":0,"exp":"54 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **54**.","k":"a2adbd87"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part mana yang berisi pengumuman dan pesan telepon?","options":["Part 4","Part 1","Part 5","Part 7"],"answer":0,"exp":"Talks. Jawaban yang tepat: **Part 4**.","k":"ae813776"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part mana yang berisi percakapan dua atau tiga orang?","options":["Part 3","Part 2","Part 6","Part 5"],"answer":0,"exp":"Conversations.","k":"73be5f4c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part mana yang melengkapi teks pendek?","options":["Part 6","Part 4","Part 1","Part 3"],"answer":0,"exp":"Text Completion.","k":"008c8dec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part mana yang berisi email, iklan, dan artikel?","options":["Part 7","Part 1","Part 2","Part 4"],"answer":0,"exp":"Reading Comprehension.","k":"b4147564"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part mana yang menguji tata bahasa dan kosakata dalam satu kalimat?","options":["Part 5","Part 3","Part 4","Part 2"],"answer":0,"exp":"Incomplete Sentences.","k":"41750d5b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apakah ada pengurangan nilai bila jawaban salah?","options":["tidak","ya, satu poin","ya, setengah poin","tergantung part"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tidak ada pengurangan; jangan kosongkan.","k":"fff56ae2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa kali rekaman Listening diputar?","options":["sekali","dua kali","tiga kali","sampai selesai dijawab"],"answer":0,"exp":"Hanya sekali.","k":"54da0e76"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Topik utama soal TOEIC adalah...","options":["dunia kerja dan komunikasi bisnis","sejarah dunia","ilmu fisika","sastra klasik"],"answer":0,"exp":"Konteks kerja.","k":"7dd8320e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Strategi yang tepat bila tidak tahu jawabannya:","options":["tebak, jangan dikosongkan","biarkan kosong","hentikan tes","minta bantuan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tidak ada pengurangan nilai.","k":"06982e18"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part mana yang sebaiknya dikerjakan paling cepat?","options":["Part 5","Part 7","Part 3","Part 4"],"answer":0,"exp":"Part 5 pendek, sekitar 20 detik per soal.","k":"e8da5857"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mengapa kamu perlu membaca soal Part 3 dan 4 sebelum rekaman?","options":["agar tahu apa yang dicari","agar waktu habis","karena dilarang mendengar","agar tidak perlu mendengar"],"answer":0,"exp":"Preview soal.","k":"3b4114d7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban jebakan di Listening sering...","options":["memuat kata yang bunyinya mirip","selalu paling panjang","selalu \"Yes\"","berupa angka"],"answer":0,"exp":"Waspadai kata mirip.","k":"f6d2489f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pada Part 7, soal \"What is the purpose of the email?\" menanyakan...","options":["tujuan email","nama pengirim","tanggal","panjang email"],"answer":0,"exp":"Purpose = tujuan.","k":"4220ffc2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pada Part 3, soal \"What will the woman do next?\" menanyakan...","options":["tindakan berikutnya","asal wanita","umur wanita","pekerjaan wanita"],"answer":0,"exp":"Next = berikutnya.","k":"ddbdb036"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Total soal TOEIC L&R adalah...","options":["200","100","150","300"],"answer":0,"exp":"200. Jawaban yang tepat: **200**.","k":"ed941aaa"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Skor TOEIC L&R berkisar...","options":["10 sampai 990","0 sampai 100","1 sampai 9","100 sampai 1000"],"answer":0,"exp":"10–990. Jawaban yang tepat: **10 sampai 990**.","k":"5abe009d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian Reading berlangsung...","options":["75 menit","45 menit","30 menit","120 menit"],"answer":0,"exp":"75 menit. Jawaban yang tepat: **75 menit**.","k":"8a457cae"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 1 adalah...","options":["Photographs","Talks","Text Completion","Reading Comprehension"],"answer":0,"exp":"Photographs. Jawaban yang tepat: **Photographs**.","k":"29083161"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 6 adalah...","options":["Text Completion","Conversations","Photographs","Talks"],"answer":0,"exp":"Text Completion.","k":"d5d3c280"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 4 berisi...","options":["pengumuman dan pesan telepon","foto","email","kalimat rumpang"],"answer":0,"exp":"Talks. Jawaban yang tepat: **pengumuman dan pesan telepon**.","k":"3d00971c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bila ragu pada satu soal...","options":["tebak dan lanjut","kosongkan","hentikan tes","menyerah"],"answer":0,"exp":"Jangan buang waktu.","k":"5959d8de"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Konteks soal TOEIC umumnya...","options":["dunia kerja","fisika","sejarah kuno","olahraga profesional"],"answer":0,"exp":"Dunia kerja. Jawaban yang tepat: **dunia kerja**.","k":"7fee294b"}],"read":[]}